# Distribution / packaging
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
# 例外：前端源码目录。上面的 Python 规则 `lib/` 会连带忽略 web/src/lib/，
# 导致 src/lib/utils.js 从未被提交，vite 构建报 "Could not resolve ../../lib/utils"。
!web/src/lib/
!web/src/lib/**
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
pip-wheel-metadata/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
